    "noOwnedCapacityOrRetentionAdded": true,
    "domain": "Private WriteByteRow reached only for RGBA8/nonwide/nonmixed cached workspace; horizontal/vertical support<=16. Guarded shared helper already covers narrow/wide400/2^40 accumulation bound. Actual destination is operation-private until successful public return.",
    "certificate": "Existing reciprocal14/Newton relative error<2^-27 and critical quotient257 give RGB<7.852e-6/alpha<2.660e-6, below2^-16 margin with normalizer>=.5/alphaSum>=16. Helper false writes nothing; original-order/tiny-alpha repair remains.",
